// Dialog :
"P2617284076" "You've rescued Arnold Decker from his captors!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1127538586" "The implications of Mr. Decker's tale are astonishing, to say the least.  But the real nature of his captors was perhaps even more so.  There will be time to consider that later.  For the moment, we must decide whether we should act on Mr. Decker's information.  I will make the case before <color deepskyblue>Lady Grey</color>.  If she agrees, I'll need your help if we are to have any chance of success."
// RandomFameString :
"P3329097846" "So I said to my cou... Lord Nemesis is watching you, {HeroName} ...sin that I just don't know about these Vanguard guys."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2637525819" "Lady Grey has agreed to the proposed operation to help Mr. Decker.  What surprised me is that Dark Watcher was also in favor.  This may still be a trap, but if the story is true, <color orange>recovering Benjamin A. Decker could be a breakthrough for us</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P3671452511" "Rescue Benjamin A. Decker"
// SendOffString :
"P1637398671" "According to the information he provided Arnold Decker, our defector will be part of a raiding contingent that will attack one of our bases.  His Rikti name is <color deepskyblue>B'Nadek</color>.  Our forces can fend off the raid; your job is just to recover Arnold's putative brother. <br><br>Oh, there's one more thing.  <color orange>The Dark Watcher wants to talk to you once this is done</color>.  I don't know why.  It seems Lady Grey is the only one he ever explains himself to."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1768870220" "Rescue B'Nadek"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2435075960" "Our forces will only put up token resistance until you've extracted B'Nadek.  We'll take care of it after you're done, so don't worry about the fighting.  The defector is your only concern."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3030892768" "The Vanguard are taking a great risk by letting this base go so lightly defended."

