// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1764668578" "You weren't able to avoid alerting the Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3632112263" "Well handled, {HeroName}.  We have lots of new information, a confirmation of Ben A. Decker's story, and the Rikti are none the wiser.  It's really a shame I'm about to lose your services.  Serpent Drummer has requested your assistance, you see.  Well, no matter.  I have a lot to do, anyway.  It has been very pleasant working with you. <br><br>Oh?  What's this?  A file from the Dark Watcher?  Certainly I'll take a look at... <br><br>Oh... my... <br><br>Please excuse me.  I think I need to read this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2577871171" "Well, that could have gone better, but, I suppose you've done well enough, all things considered.  It would have been nice to learn more, but now we have some idea of what's going on, and we have some evidence.  We can trust B'Nadek.  You've done enough right that Serpent Drummer wants to work with you.  A good thing, I think, considering that I'm going to be very busy for a while. <br><br>What's this?  A file from the Dark Watcher?  Certainly I'll take a look at... <br><br>Oh... my... <br><br>Please excuse me.  I think I need to read this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
